think Last lap ended on a state the tree had no column for: two witnesses that neither passed nor failed. Built the column before spending another lap counting into the wrong one.
think The probe runs one witness under a NAMED bound and answers green, red, hung or absent. The distinction that matters is hung against red -- a red is a claim about the tree, a timeout is a claim about the run, and my own classifier last lap wrote red for two scripts that had returned no answer at all.
think Exit code 124 is what timeout returns when it kills its child, so the distinction is exact rather than inferred. It reports the seconds burned either way, so a slow witness reads differently from a stuck one without a second run.
think The control plants all four verdicts and asserts the central distinction FROM BOTH SIDES -- a hang is never called a red, a refusal is never called a hang. A probe that has only ever seen green cannot be trusted to make the call the day it matters.
obs THE FIRST HONEST CENSUS OF THE UNREACHED CHOIRS: 80 probed, 48 green, 30 red, 2 hung. Every one of the 48 green was reached by no pass, so a green choir that stopped being green had nothing to say so.
obs And all 48 live in ONE room -- tools/equinox/witness, the family an earlier lap declined to glob. The decline was right and it was about the PREFIX: a glob there overstates by 111. Reaching them through the choirs they already had asks each family its own question, since a choir knows its members where a prefix only guesses.
obs Rostered as a RATCHET rather than a wall, with ceilings on 30 standing reds and 2 hangs. A wall would refuse the roster on reds that stood before anyone looked, and a guard that refuses on ordinary standing state is one somebody turns off. The 50 green begin running tonight; the 30 red stay counted rather than blocking.
obs unreached falls 750 to 643, a fall of 107 and the largest yet. Six rows now carry six families.
